From: OCCTSwift ecosystem <noreply@secondmouse.au>
Subject: [PATCH] Modeling Algorithms - ChFi3d_Builder::StartSol drops an obstacle it found no edge for

When the obstacle face has no edge matching the arc edge, StartSol returned false with HC
a default-constructed adaptor (no curve) and c1obstacle still set. The caller took the empty
adaptor for a curve and the SurfRst walk dereferenced a null Geom2d curve (SIGSEGV).

Nullify HC and clear c1obstacle in that branch, so the caller sees the state it already
handles for "no obstacle". The fillet is then declined instead of crashing.

Adds a GTest that builds a pocketed plate in code and rounds its rim over a bottom round.

Upstream: Open-Cascade-SAS/OCCT#1623 (fork branch SecondMouseAU/OCCT fix/chfi3d-startsol-obstacle). This is the form of that
pull request as it stacks on the earlier patches of this series; where it differs from the pull request
as submitted it is only in the lines the stack made conflict (see Scripts/patches/README.md). The DRAW
test cases under tests/ that the pull request edits are not part of this patch: the build has no Draw.

---
diff --git a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/ChFi3d/ChFi3d_Builder_2.cxx b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/ChFi3d/ChFi3d_Builder_2.cxx
index b29aa18fc4..1b147b9fc8 100644
--- a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/ChFi3d/ChFi3d_Builder_2.cxx
+++ b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/ChFi3d/ChFi3d_Builder_2.cxx
@@ -1567,6 +1567,9 @@ bool ChFi3d_Builder::StartSol(
         }
         else
         {
+          // The obstacle face has no edge to follow, so HC holds no curve: this is not an obstacle.
+          HC.Nullify();
+          c1obstacle = false;
           prepareDefaultReturn();
           return false;
         }
diff --git a/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/GTests/BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet_Obstacle_Test.cxx b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/GTests/BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet_Obstacle_Test.cxx
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..c733979ed7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/ModelingAlgorithms/TKFillet/GTests/BRepFilletAPI_MakeFillet_Obstacle_Test.cxx
@@ -0,0 +1,133 @@
